• Each 8-dimensional minimal left ideal contains exactly one generation of Standard Model leptons and quarks (neutrino, electron, 3 up quarks, 3 down quarks), while the quaternions (\(\mathbb{H}\)) and complex numbers (\(\mathbb{C}\)) supply the \(SU(2)_L \times U(1)_Y\) electroweak and Lorentz spacetime symmetries.
